---
/**
 * Interactive blueprint dot-field behind the hero.
 * - Ambient: a slow diagonal wave ripples through the grid.
 * - Pointer: nearby dots are pushed away and lit in the accent colour.
 * - Click / tap: emits a shockwave ring.
 * Pauses when off-screen or the tab is hidden; renders a single static frame under reduced motion.
 * Behaviour lives in src/scripts/hero-field.
 */
---

<canvas data-hero-field aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full"></canvas>
